{"id":"d_main_27_08","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch27","label":"Chapter 27 · Exploration"},"label":"Take the Hard Path","stage":"27-30 STAGE · Start","prev":"d_main_27_07","next":"d_main_27_09_s","speakers":{"hammering":"Hammering","liveryn":"Liveryn","rapi":"Rapi","neon":"Neon","elegg":"Elegg","anis":"Anis","shifty":"Shifty"},"icons":{"hammering":"si_c490_00_s","liveryn":"si_c480_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s","elegg":"si_c500_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s","shifty":"si_c907_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_27_08_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_1","text":"The path is getting narrower.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"ManyCrystalDesert_d","bgArt":"manycrystaldesert_d","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_aztec_b","movie":null,"shown":["hammering","liveryn","elegg","rapi","anis","neon"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_2","text":"It wasn't like this on the map.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_3","text":"Then again, I guess we can't expect all the details to be exact.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_4","text":"Especially since it's a map displaying an aerial view from above.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_5","text":"Is it just me, or are we totally screwed if any Raptures come at us from either side?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_6","text":"I'll watch the rear. I'll need someone else to help.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_7","text":"I'll join you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_8","text":"Thanks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_9","text":"By the way, watch your step, everyone. This place is flooded with crystals.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_10","text":"Yeah, the crystals dot almost every inch of the ground and walls. We can't touch anything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_11","text":"I don't even want to think about fighting in a place like this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_12","text":"If we were sent flying and fell into a crystal cluster, we'd end up being drained and then dying,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_13","text":"just like that Rapture we saw yesterday.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_14","text":"I was thinking about that actually, and I believe it can be solved quite easily.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_15","text":"All we've got to do is remove our heads.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_16","text":"... What?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_17","text":"If we're between a rock and hard place, removing our heads will solve the problem. The crystals would ravage our bodies and suck them dry,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_18","text":"but so long as our heads remain intact, we'll be able to stay alive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_19","text":"An interesting theory, but how many people are actually going to be willing to go through with it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_20","text":"Why would there be any hesitation? It's 100% the safest and most foolproof method.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_21","text":"Ms. Hammering, have you ever died before?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_22","text":"No.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_23","text":"Neither have I, but I think it's something more severe than being solved simply by removing a body part.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_24","text":"The Counters are hardened warriors, so maybe they've experienced something like that before?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_25","text":"Yes, I have.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_26","text":"Me too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_27","text":"Called it!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_28","text":"I haven't, because I'm so amazing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_29","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_30","text":"Could you please explain to Ms. Hammering on how difficult dying is?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_31","text":"Dying isn't an easy thing, even more so when it's by your own hand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_32","text":"Did you hear that, Ms. Hammering?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_33","text":"Really? I guess I don't know since I've never been in that kind of situation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_34","text":"I guess I'll find out when I'm faced with it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_35","text":"Ideally you would never have to face a situation like that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_36","text":"Very true.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_37","text":"The best way to deal with this sort of thing is to prepare for the worst.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_38","text":"I've imagined the worst-case scenario in my head countless times,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_39","text":"but when it comes, I never deal with it the way I'm supposed to. Not like when it's during a simulated battle.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_40","text":"Yeah? What is it that you imagine?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_41","text":"Don't ask.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_42","text":"It's so bad that I can't even say it out loud.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_43","text":"... Okay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_44","text":"Shifty, what's ahead of us?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_45","text":"The downtown area.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["shifty"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_46","text":"This city used to be a moderate-sized trade hub. Other than that, there was nothing particularly noteworthy about it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_47","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_47","text":"After we pass through here, does the path end?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_48","text":"I can't be certain. Even this narrow path we're on now wasn't on the map.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_49","text":"I did find something unusual though. The map indicates that there's something massive just on the outskirts of the city.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_50","text":"However, any further statements without visual confirmation would simply be conjecture.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_51","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_51","text":"Okay. Let's keep going then.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_08_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_08_52","text":"Roger.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}